# Banking Data Platform

An enterprise-grade, event-driven banking data processing platform built with modern Java and clean architecture principles.

## Tech Stack
- Java 21
- Spring Boot 3
- Apache Kafka (Streaming)
- Spring Batch (Batch Processing)
- Elasticsearch (Search & Analytics)
- Redis (Caching)
- Micrometer (Observability)
- Docker

## Architecture
This project follows **Clean Architecture** principles:
- Domain is framework-agnostic
- Application layer contains pure use cases
- Infrastructure handles Kafka, persistence, search, cache
- Spring is used only for wiring and adapters

## Current Features
- Core banking domain model with validations
- Transaction processing use case
- Fully unit-tested domain and application layers
- Multi-module Maven structure

## Planned Features
- Kafka consumer with retry & DLQ
- Batch aggregation jobs
- REST API for search and reports
- Docker Compose setup

## Status
🚧 In active development
